<description>&lt;p&gt;The International Court of Justice ruled that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya, prompting the U.K. to sanction five senior Myanmar military officials. The Myanmar junta carried out airstrikes in Pauktaw that killed four civilians, including an infant. Malaysia is repatriating another 6,803 Myanmar nationals despite the genocide ruling. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/24/malaysia-set-to-return-thousands-of-rohingya-refugees-to-myanmar-2?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQdjFkZ2JDbm9zS191dGVPU01XcElTSW1xNEVmbG5vbGRCZC1aaDhyRS1uazQ5bkFvZ2lvcVhWRGxxVTlYUTBpUUVtWktteTRSdFFkQ0R1cG5UdXQtUWVtTzF6UURfN0dzN3RvV0gtMVZ3Q2hPYmhRUVdlQWo0Z3VuMEI4LUZoMWZnaFZBMGxDekdyN2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/24/malaysia-to-send-thousands-of-migrants-back-to-myanmar&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/nov/24/myanmar-found-guilty-genocide-should-israel-be-worried-podcast&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPcXZWcVR5SXE3TkpKcXJFaGhwczRGMHJMTDZnYXB4c3oxalBtbEkzY2xWa0pmeGphVlNOTUQ2SmVXQ1RnOGlGUmJhanJodEZla2o4aWlha3pac1pGLWFfc3NLVlptcVRxSko1Q3lfNHZ1cU82a0hEUW5vMnNyLURYVHhxQXo1OTMwbGVCZGhHYVNJQm9VUFctc3NVdktwb1JTTXNSM0pRajZDS08zU3Q3bDIyOGE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1zaF9CbVU1VWJPN3BrZ3VmTG81UnBrQnk3T01CM2dyVUE4SmlfYXdHd